{"id":"461236997f41a313","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-kurtz-test.md","title":"一致有效 clopen 的 Kurtz 检验","display":"df-kurtz-test — 一致有效 clopen 的 Kurtz 检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-kurtz-test","aliases":["20-df-kurtz-test"],"display":"df-kurtz-test — 一致有效 clopen 的 Kurtz 检验","chapter":"11","section":"11.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 11.4.3","source_printed_pages":[193],"source_pdf_pages":[224],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-kurtz-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-kurtz-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kurtz-test — 一致有效 clopen 的 Kurtz 检验"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 11.4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>224</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(V_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\(V=(V_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_z\">\\(\\sigma_z\\)</span> 是编号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的有限二进制串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 是全可计算一元函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurtz-test}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzTest}(V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[V_n=\\bigcup_{z\\in D_{g(n)}}[\\sigma_z]\\land\\mu(V_n)&lt;2^{-n}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurtz-test}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzTest}(V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[V_n=\\bigcup_{z\\in D_{g(n)}}[\\sigma_z]\\land\\mu(V_n)&lt;2^{-n}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每层的有限柱并 clopen，全部有限代码由一个全可计算函数给出；不能只要求每层各自存在某个代码。有限柱并的测度要去掉前缀覆盖重叠后计算，不能直接相加。失败者属于全部层的交。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.4.3；印刷页 193；PDF 第 224 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V=(V_n)_{n\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_z","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurtz-test}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzTest}(V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[V_n=\\bigcup_{z\\in D_{g(n)}}[\\sigma_z]\\land\\mu(V_n)<2^{-n}].","display":true}],"bytes":1445,"backlinks":[{"id":"12b65ff45a1e7d01","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kurtz-test]]；see [[20-df-kurtz-random]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-kurtz-test]] — 章 11；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-kurtz-test]]"}],"outgoing":["59004ac6d23e86f8","755e421576224435","978bb51599bc5702","e343870c773cb68e"]}